{"id":"d10c661122833e3a","group":"68","path":"68/68-thm-re-degree-structure-theorem.md","title":"r.e. Degree Structure Theorem","display":"thm-re-degree-structure-theorem — r.e. Degree Structure Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-thm-re-degree-structure-theorem","aliases":["68-thm-re-degree-structure-theorem"],"display":"thm-re-degree-structure-theorem — r.e. Degree Structure Theorem","depends_on":["[[68-df-recursively-enumerable-degree]]","[[68-df-partial-order-on-degrees]]","[[68-df-degree-join]]","[[68-df-incomparable-degrees]]","[[68-thm-friedberg-muchnik-theorem]]","[[68-thm-jump-theorem]]","[[68-thm-re-degree-density]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"Supplementary entry; not located in the supplied Shoenfield PDF; base components: §15 pp.54-58 / PDF 63-67","verification_status":"pending-source","source_proof_status":"mixed: base arguments reviewed; density proof not checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-thm-re-degree-structure-theorem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-thm-re-degree-structure-theorem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-re-degree-structure-theorem — r.e. Degree Structure Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4516136f3cd44eb2\" href=\"?note=4516136f3cd44eb2\" title=\"68-df-recursively-enumerable-degree\">68-df-recursively-enumerable-degree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"52c2209f400df1a9\" href=\"?note=52c2209f400df1a9\" title=\"68-df-partial-order-on-degrees\">68-df-partial-order-on-degrees</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4ed6f28789f0aa57\" href=\"?note=4ed6f28789f0aa57\" title=\"68-df-degree-join\">68-df-degree-join</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"341dbc6a97001587\" href=\"?note=341dbc6a97001587\" title=\"68-df-incomparable-degrees\">68-df-incomparable-degrees</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0cca9651cac638c4\" href=\"?note=0cca9651cac638c4\" title=\"68-thm-friedberg-muchnik-theorem\">68-thm-friedberg-muchnik-theorem</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"87e145f3544aae62\" href=\"?note=87e145f3544aae62\" title=\"68-thm-jump-theorem\">68-thm-jump-theorem</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"7d8fc4959ae00cc7\" href=\"?note=7d8fc4959ae00cc7\" title=\"68-thm-re-degree-density\">68-thm-re-degree-density</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Supplementary entry; not located in the supplied Shoenfield PDF; base components: §15 pp.54-58 / PDF 63-67"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"pending-source"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"mixed: base arguments reviewed; density proof not checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{REDeg}\">\\(\\mathrm{REDeg}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"4516136f3cd44eb2\" href=\"?note=4516136f3cd44eb2\" title=\"68-df-recursively-enumerable-degree\">68-df-recursively-enumerable-degree</a>，度序与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf0,\\mathbf0&#39;\">\\(\\mathbf0,\\mathbf0&#39;\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"52c2209f400df1a9\" href=\"?note=52c2209f400df1a9\" title=\"68-df-partial-order-on-degrees\">68-df-partial-order-on-degrees</a> 的上游；度 join 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"4ed6f28789f0aa57\" href=\"?note=4ed6f28789f0aa57\" title=\"68-df-degree-join\">68-df-degree-join</a>；不可比性见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"341dbc6a97001587\" href=\"?note=341dbc6a97001587\" title=\"68-df-incomparable-degrees\">68-df-incomparable-degrees</a>。稠密性部分依赖尚待来源核验的 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"7d8fc4959ae00cc7\" href=\"?note=7d8fc4959ae00cc7\" title=\"68-thm-re-degree-density\">68-thm-re-degree-density</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf0,\\mathbf0&#39;\\in\\mathrm{REDeg}\\ \\land\\ \\forall\\mathbf a\\in\\mathrm{REDeg}\\;(\\mathbf0\\le\\mathbf a\\land\\mathbf a\\le\\mathbf0&#39;).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf0,\\mathbf0&#39;\\in\\mathrm{REDeg}\\ \\land\\ \\forall\\mathbf a\\in\\mathrm{REDeg}\\;(\\mathbf0\\le\\mathbf a\\land\\mathbf a\\le\\mathbf0&#39;).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b\\in\\mathrm{REDeg}\\;(\\mathbf a\\oplus\\mathbf b\\in\\mathrm{REDeg}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b\\in\\mathrm{REDeg}\\;(\\mathbf a\\oplus\\mathbf b\\in\\mathrm{REDeg}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b\\in\\mathrm{REDeg}\\;(\\mathbf a&lt;\\mathbf b\\Longrightarrow\\exists\\mathbf c\\in\\mathrm{REDeg}\\;(\\mathbf a&lt;\\mathbf c\\land\\mathbf c&lt;\\mathbf b)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b\\in\\mathrm{REDeg}\\;(\\mathbf a&lt;\\mathbf b\\Longrightarrow\\exists\\mathbf c\\in\\mathrm{REDeg}\\;(\\mathbf a&lt;\\mathbf c\\land\\mathbf c&lt;\\mathbf b)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b\\in\\mathrm{REDeg}\\;(\\mathbf a\\mid\\mathbf b),\\qquad|\\mathrm{REDeg}|=\\aleph_0.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b\\in\\mathrm{REDeg}\\;(\\mathbf a\\mid\\mathbf b),\\qquad|\\mathrm{REDeg}|=\\aleph_0.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>边界度和不可比性分别对应原书 p.55 与 15.5，join 闭合来自交错枚举两个 r.e. 代表。可数性来自索引枚举及无穷多度；稠密性是扩展项 Sacks 定理，未在给定 PDF 找到，故整项汇总保持 pending，不能当作已核验的全体结论。原先“非零 r.e. 度无极小者”的一式已由稠密性涵盖。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-recursively-enumerable-degree","status":"resolved","id":"4516136f3cd44eb2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-recursively-enumerable-degree]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-partial-order-on-degrees","status":"resolved","id":"52c2209f400df1a9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-partial-order-on-degrees]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-degree-join","status":"resolved","id":"4ed6f28789f0aa57","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-degree-join]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-incomparable-degrees","status":"resolved","id":"341dbc6a97001587","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-incomparable-degrees]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-thm-friedberg-muchnik-theorem","status":"resolved","id":"0cca9651cac638c4","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-thm-friedberg-muchnik-theorem]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-thm-jump-theore